  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="codex">
        <pb n="1" facs="#f01" />
        <div n="1" type="scan" subtype="illustrated-anti-opium-broadside">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f01-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">諸位同胞們今日見了這張圖萬不可將此圖看成兒戲的物件卻人</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f01-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">因為這鴉片烟的器俱確確是害人終身的物件故此把這烟具烟膏</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f01-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">全比成最毒最害人的物件烟膏確確是金銀膏每日往口裏吸金銀</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f01-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">諸位想想把那好好的金銀換了許多的毒藥為的是什麼呢烟炮</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f01-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">就是毒蠍子因為此物螫人將毒水入至血肉裏去難過的很諸位</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f01-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">萬不可說吃一口身上很爽快教□人看若是吃一口就是挨了</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f01-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">蠍子一回螫人若是終日被蠍子螫日子久了還能生活嗎烟斗比成</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f01-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一個疥蛤蟆因為人若生了疥一時難以好烟斗拔子用一個蠍虎</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f01-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">兒此物的確能為死人烟槍是一條大蜈蚣蜈蚣的口齒最毒咬人</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f01-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一口血肉腐爛烟燈乃是一條毒蛇蛇的舌頭俗語叫作毒劍以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f01-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">蛇的舌頭當作燈心以氣為火此種毒氣不問可知蜘蛛網可以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="12" xml:id="f01-s-c12">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">害萬物以此為燈罩日久把家產全被他網了去打烟的烟板是</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="13" xml:id="f01-s-c13">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一個拘魂牌無論何時把他拿起身家性命全不顧了只知快燒烟</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="14" xml:id="f01-s-c14">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">炮好過他的癮就如失了魂的一般烟籤子就是一支大籤拿</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="15" xml:id="f01-s-c15">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">在手裏如同受大刑的一樣多燒一個烟炮兒就是多加了一點刑法</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="16" xml:id="f01-s-c16">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">烟盤子純乎是一面枷自從擺上烟盤子那日起就算是上這面</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="17" xml:id="f01-s-c17">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">大烟枷一日不戒此枷就一日不能開釋看那人口裏噴的烟氣全</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="18" xml:id="f01-s-c18">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">是各種小五毒奉勸不吃烟的人萬不可同那吃烟的人一同坐卧</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="19" xml:id="f01-s-c19">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">因為聞久了這種烟氣是一樣的受病哪同胞們都快想一想這毒</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="20" xml:id="f01-s-c20">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">蠍被毒蛇口中的火一燒就攅到疥蛤蟆的腹内由疥蛤蟆的腹内歸</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="21" xml:id="f01-s-c21">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">到蠍虎的臟腑中蠍虎溜在蜈蚣的腸胃裏再吸到人的口中你想這</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="22" xml:id="f01-s-c22">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">各種的毒氣由蜈蚣口裏吸到我同胞的臟腑裏頭請問諸位這吃</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="23" xml:id="f01-s-c23">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">大烟的人還能生活嗎好聞烟的人如何不一同受病呢你看這吃</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="24" xml:id="f01-s-c24">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">烟的人眼前守著許多的刑具内裏頭受了許多的毒氣外面又得</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="25" xml:id="f01-s-c25">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">受刑法諸位看看可怕不可怕快快的將大烟戒了罷身體可以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="26" xml:id="f01-s-c26">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">健壯家業又可以保全為什麼不把他戒掉了呢現由美國萬</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="27" xml:id="f01-s-c27">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">國改良會分出一個改良支會設在中國天津的地方為的</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="28" xml:id="f01-s-c28">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">是改良社會風俗現在被這大烟毒害的人實是不少了所</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="29" xml:id="f01-s-c29">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以演出這一篇白話並且繪出一個可怕的圖救我數千萬受</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="30" xml:id="f01-s-c30">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">了病的同胞們諸位呀那時拿起烟具來先看看這張圖</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="31" xml:id="f01-s-c31">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">到底可怕不可怕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-imprint">
              <label>正文左側年款</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">宣統二年歲次庚戌小陽月</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-imprint">
              <label>正文左側署款</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">萬國改良會全權代表員丁義華敬送</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-imprint">
              <label>左邊框內小款</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">醒華報館代印</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-slogan">
              <label>中下大字第一欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">外人輸入</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-slogan">
              <label>中下大字第二欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">我國之鴉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-slogan">
              <label>中下大字第三欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">片烟如無</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-slogan">
              <label>中下大字第四欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">形毒枷我</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-slogan">
              <label>中下大字第五欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">同胞速脫</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-slogan">
              <label>中下大字第六欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">此刑萬勿</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-slogan">
              <label>中下大字第七欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">待七年後</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-slogan">
              <label>中下大字第八欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">以開釋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="figure-label" facs="#f01-drawing">
              <label>圖中旗上四個白圈</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">改良支會</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="figure-label" facs="#f01-drawing">
              <label>圖中罐身</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">金銀膏</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="figure-label" facs="#f01-drawing">
              <label>圖中枷上大字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">毒枷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="figure-label" facs="#f01-drawing">
              <label>圖中枷上方斜條</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">價值二百□四百九十六萬□</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="figure-label" facs="#f01-drawing">
              <label>圖中枷下方斜條</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">□□□八百五十四萬</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：單張正面，來源圖為灰階，無可確定的色筆層。上半部直書白話，由右至左一物理欄一行，字間空隙未人工補標點。圖中文字另錄，兩條斜籤的數字不作定讀。上斜條百後近「兆」，末字近「元」；下斜條局部被人物及畫線遮掩，左端字序仍待校，□不表示確知實際缺字數。旗上尚見圖樣與中心十字形，十字不作文字。 單幅：右一起列末「卻人」、第二欄「器俱」、第六欄「教□人看」（缺字外形近部或別）、第九欄「為死人」、第二十欄「攅」「歸」、第二十四欄「守著」、第二十九欄「演」、斜籤等可回圖覆核。正文用「烟」並保留；左下圖旁印款與印目相符。宣統二年庚戌為1910，Walravens 1994 頁53第95條與此同圖，雖著錄相同年號卻誤注1863。毒枷是圖內字，可作借用擬題。 單幅：館方公開影像為一張紙的正面，無背面影像。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:6">
              <quote>□</quote>
              <note type="editorial">部分筆畫不清，原圖字形待核。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:31">
              <quote>圖中枷上方斜條</quote>
              <note type="editorial">此處墨跡或構件不清，以□保留未定字。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:31">
              <quote>圖中枷下方斜條</quote>
              <note type="editorial">此處墨跡或構件不清，以□保留未定字。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
